---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Privacy" description="Learn how YMR handles information submitted through its contact, prayer request, and testimony forms.">
  <main id="main" class="resource-page info-page">
    <section class="resource-hero section-wrap" id="top" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
      <span class="section-index">YOUR INFORMATION</span>
      <div class="resource-hero__row">
        <div><h1 id="privacy-title">Privacy at<br /><span>YMR Global.</span></h1><p>We ask for only the information needed to respond to you and manage your submission.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="resource-note section-wrap" aria-label="Privacy information">
      <div>
        <h2>Forms and messages</h2>
        <p>When configured, information you submit through the prayer request and testimony forms is stored in YMR’s Supabase database so the team can review and respond. Testimony submissions are held for review and are not automatically published. Do not include sensitive information you do not want YMR to receive.</p>
        <p>Prayer requests may contain personal or sensitive details. Share only what you are comfortable sending, and avoid including private information about another person. Please email <a href="mailto:info@ymrglobal.org">info@ymrglobal.org</a> with questions or to request help with a submission.</p>
        <h2>Testimonies and publication</h2>
        <p>Submitting a testimony does not automatically publish it. Before publishing an identifiable story, the YMR team should obtain your permission and confirm the name format you prefer. You can ask the team to use your first name, an abbreviated name, or no name.</p>
        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <p>Supabase provides the hosted database used to store submissions. Review <a href="https://supabase.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Supabase’s privacy policy</a>. Contact YMR at <a href="mailto:info@ymrglobal.org">info@ymrglobal.org</a> to ask about or request deletion of a submission. YMR should confirm its retention period and access practices before launch.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
